      <p source="#source-447-623"><seg source="#source-447-459">先刻御面</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-462-507"><seg source="#source-459-462">遠</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-483-492">（倒）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-507-543">御頼申上候。早速御世話被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-543-555">レ</note><seg source="#source-555-561">遣難</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-561-573">レ</note><seg source="#source-573-585">有次第奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-585-597">二</note><seg source="#source-597-603">万謝</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-603-615">一</note><seg source="#source-615-623">候。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-623-745"><seg source="#source-623-722">然ニ別封桂小五郎先生まで相達申度、何時ニてもよろしく御便の節御送奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-722-734">レ</note><seg source="#source-734-745">願候。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-745-774"><seg source="#source-745-774">何卒宜御願申上候。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-774-839" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p source="#source-795-839"><seg source="#source-795-807">正月三日</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-807-839" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-825-839">拝稽首。</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-839-868" style="padding-inline-end: 0em; text-align: right">
