        <p source="#source-988-1039"><seg source="#source-988-1018">久保松太郎様　虎皮下</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1018-1039" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-1036-1039">龍</seg></seg></p>
